<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia to close Jan. coffee registrations.</title>
<headline>Colombia to close Jan. coffee registrations.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia will close coffee registrations for January shipments by Federation exporters on Jan 10, National Coffee Growers' Federation said Wednesday.</p>
<p>((--Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom 571 610 7944))</p>
